WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.400
-Friday.
-Today's Friday,

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.567
and that's usually when I catch
up with some personal stuff.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.300
I check my inbox.
I return some emails.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.300
And, of course,
send out thank-you notes.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.133
And I was just running...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:10.834
...running a bit behind.

00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:12.501
So, I thought if you guys
wouldn't mind, can I write out

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:14.400
my weekly thank-you notes
right now for you guys?

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.767
Paul -- Paul, could I get some
"thank-you note writing" music?

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:20.400
-Yes, here it is, yeah.
[ Somber music plays ]

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:25.367
♪♪

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:26.567
-So somber.
-It's so fun.

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:28.300
-So somber.
-This is so fun --

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.701
just seeing this
and hearing this.

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:31.334
I'm having the greatest time
right now.

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:32.868
[ Breathes sharply ]

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:34.767
♪♪

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.267
Thank you, Beyoncé Tour,

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:40.634
for making my newest hobby
refreshing Ticketmaster.

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:42.133
[ Applause ]

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.000
♪♪

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:50.367
♪♪

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:55.033
Thank you, cocktail sauce,
for being an overly elegant name

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:57.067
for something that's 90% Heinz.

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:59.000
[ Laughter and applause ]
It's like, "Cocktail sauce?"

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.367
-Ooh-la-la!
-[ Chuckles ]

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:05.667
-Mmm! Catsup.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:07.534
♪♪

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:11.501
Thank you, massive Chinese
spy balloon over Montana.

00:01:11.501 --> 00:01:12.901
I can't wait to see you

00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:14.701
in this year's
Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade.

00:01:14.701 --> 00:01:16.200
That's going to be --
That's going to be --

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:19.400
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Hey!

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.834
Whoa!

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:24.968
[ Chuckles ]
-Coming down 5th Ave.

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:28.267
♪♪

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:30.567
Thank you, snow mobiles,

00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:32.901
for looking like
a Transformer planking.

00:01:32.901 --> 00:01:34.834
[ Applause ]

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:37.667
♪♪

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:42.267
♪♪

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:47.801
Thank you, Netflix
cracking down on shared logins,

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:50.501
for severing our last tie
to our college roommate.

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:51.801
[ Laughter and applause ]
That's it.

00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:53.234
Now we're done.

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:54.734
Goodbye.
Out of my life.

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:56.300
-Yeah.
Never going to see them again.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.667
-Out of my life.

00:01:57.667 --> 00:01:59.934
♪♪

00:02:00.634 --> 00:02:02.167
♪♪

00:02:02.167 --> 00:02:07.667
Thank you, puffy coats,
for giving me full-body abs.

00:02:07.667 --> 00:02:09.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:10.934
I've got a 20-pack.

00:02:10.934 --> 00:02:11.934
♪♪

00:02:12.634 --> 00:02:14.968
-I got a washing machine.
-I got a 25-pack.

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:17.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.100
♪♪

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:21.667
-Thank you, Paul Shaffer.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:26.701
When people -- When people talk
about legends on late-night TV,

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:29.400
you're number one
on everyone's Top Ten List.

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.400
There you have it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.167
Those were our thank-you notes.

00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:34.234
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody!

00:02:34.234 --> 00:02:35.300
Come on back!
[ Cheers and applause ]

